austive when <= 720 listed orders, else 48 samples)\")\n(def classes (atom {}))\n(doseq [[i q] @refused]\n  (swap! classes update (p/classify-refused q 720 48) (fnil inc 0)))\n(println \"REFUSED-CLASSES\" @classes)\n"}}}
