21395 at\n128 characters; encoded comparison bytes 132540 against 1718, all\ncharged before encoding).\n\nDecoder order (`rows.cljc:570-578` reproduced): the 6a fixture with a\nreserved-name binding carried under a wrong numbering decodes to\n`:noncanonical-cursor-cells`, under the right numbering to\n`:reserved-name`, and the 2-cycle with the same binding to\n`:unresolved-cursor-cells`; a valid carrier decodes."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7467,"cache_read_input_tokens":180189,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7467},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"704437a3-7e24-494b-ab26-b13fa72d3d40","uuid":"76f755b3-3785-4a2a-9d88-5a0443cf3dcb","timestamp":"2026-10-12T12:07:05.023Z","request_id":"req_011CfxK7z1M2SYnL2WNKZ7hB","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01D7rw5UXwMBguxGYmndKjGB":{"file_path":"/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-numbering/docs/design/yin.vm.semantic-register-vm.cursor-cell-numbering.md","old_string":"Gates: two cells under `{:cursor-cells 1}` and 65 cells under the\ndefault budget refuse `[:cursor-cells]`; `[[[[X]]]]` under `{:depth 3}`\nrefuses `[:depth]`; `{:work 1}` refuses `[:work]` at lift and, for a\nvalid carrier, at decode; the 400000-element literal inside a set refuses\n`[:work]`; an unreachable census cell is the defect\n`{:missing [:x], :extra []}`. The 65536-character descriptor state\nnumbers at `:work` 544554 (21290 at 128 characters; encoded comparison\nbytes 132540 against 1718, all charged before encoding).","new_string":"Gates: two cells under `{:cursor-cells 1}` and 65 cells under the\ndefault budget refuse `[:cursor-cells]`; `[[[[X]]]]`, one cell inside\n3000 and inside 10000 nested vectors, and a literal nested 3000 dee